<v Daniel>Okay, so when you say 19 studies, what are they actually testing? Like what kind of questions are they asking these AI twins?</v>

40
00:03:14.818 --> 00:03:19.541
<v Maya>They tested 164 different specific outcomes.</v>

41
00:03:19.581 --> 00:03:20.082
<v Daniel>164.</v>

42
00:03:20.182 --> 00:03:31.330
<v Maya>Yeah, they are asking questions across the entire spectrum of human behavior. So economic games, moral dilemmas, consumer choices, political preferences, survey questions.</v>

43
00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.490
