44
00:03:32.611 --> 00:03:43.120
<v Maya>Everything. They gathered 13,506 human responses. Okay. And that was from 1,784 unique human participants.</v>

45
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.862
<v Daniel>Wow. So a huge data set.</v>

46
00:03:45.022 --> 00:03:56.712
<v Maya>Massive. Then they built digital twins of those exact same people by feeding the AI their personal data. Got it. And they did this using a public data set called Twin2K500.</v>

47
00:03:57.433 --> 00:03:57.813
