98
00:08:25.919 --> 00:08:40.267
<v Maya>This is a critical point. It proves why looking at raw accuracy is a totally misleading yardstick in this field. Okay. Because if just guessing randomly gets you to 63% and knowing absolutely nothing gets you to 73%,</v>

